# Ask to commit after each chunk

After a coherent unit of work (new study CSVs, an analysis slug, a methodology lock, or a review-fix), **stop and ask** whether to commit before starting the next unit.

- Do not stack a follow-up experiment, a CLI lock, and a review fix in one uncommitted tree
- If the user says "commit and continue", commit the current chunk, then stop again after the next chunk
- Never commit unless the user asked (including in this turn)
